              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engencho eyio inche nimbaire ase obosomba ase ense ere ng’umbu ya Damesiki.” Nabo Omonene ateebire. Nyasae bw’Emeganda, nario erieta riaye.",
          "type": "text",
